{
  "name": "canary-lab",
  "version": "1.6.0",
  "description": "The independent local harness for AI-repaired Playwright tests — it runs the tests itself, so a green run can't be faked.",
  "keywords": [
    "playwright",
    "playwright-testing",
    "e2e",
    "e2e-testing",
    "testing",
    "test-automation",
    "local-development",
    "developer-tools",
    "ai-agents",
    "ai-testing",
    "coding-agents",
    "agent-harness",
    "ai-verification",
    "concurrent-testing",
    "mcp",
    "mcp-server",
    "claude",
    "claude-code",
    "codex"
  ],
  "author": {
    "name": "Fer Terahadi",
    "email": "fernanditerahadi@gmail.com",
    "url": "https://github.com/ferterahadi/canary-lab"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/ferterahadi/canary-lab.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/ferterahadi/canary-lab/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/ferterahadi/canary-lab#readme",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.12.0",
    "npm": ">=9.0.0"
  },
  "bin": {
    "canary-lab": "dist/apps/cli/cli.js"
  },
  "//exports": "Semver surface. Every scaffolded workspace on disk imports these four specifiers; renaming a source file or changing a signature is a breaking release, not a refactor. Read shared/README.md first.",
  "exports": {
    "./feature-support/playwright-base": "./dist/shared/configs/playwright.base.js",
    "./feature-support/load-env": "./dist/shared/configs/loadEnv.js",
    "./feature-support/log-marker-fixture": "./dist/shared/e2e-runner/log-marker-fixture.js",
    "./feature-support/types": "./dist/shared/launcher/types.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "tools/fix-node-pty-permissions.mjs",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node tools/gen-agents-md.mjs && node tools/gen-codex-skills.mjs && node tools/clean-dist.mjs && tsc -p tsconfig.build.json && node tools/prepare-assets.mjs && vite build --config apps/web/vite.config.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.build.json --noEmit",
    "typecheck:web": "tsc -p apps/web/tsconfig.json --noEmit",
    "typecheck:server": "tsc -p tsconfig.web-server.json --noEmit",
    "typecheck:all": "npm run typecheck && npm run typecheck:web && npm run typecheck:server",
    "gen:agents": "node tools/gen-agents-md.mjs",
    "gen:skills": "node tools/gen-codex-skills.mjs",
    "check:boundaries": "node tools/check-feature-boundaries.mjs",
    "check:conventions": "node tools/check-conventions.mjs",
    "check:docs": "node tools/check-docs.mjs",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "build:web": "vite build --config apps/web/vite.config.ts",
    "dev:web": "vite --config apps/web/vite.config.ts",
    "postinstall": "node tools/fix-node-pty-permissions.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build",
    "e2e:flight": "tsx apps/cli/e2e-flight-drive.ts",
    "smoke:pack": "node tools/smoke-pack.mjs",
    "smoke:demo": "node tools/smoke-demo.mjs",
    "demo": "node tools/smoke-demo.mjs --interactive",
    "publish:package": "node tools/publish-package.mjs",
    "changelog": "node tools/generate-changelog.mjs",
    "changelog:preview": "node tools/generate-changelog.mjs --dry-run",
    "tag": "node tools/tag-release.mjs",
    "tag:force": "node tools/tag-release.mjs --force"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@dnd-kit/core": "^6.3.1",
    "@dnd-kit/sortable": "^10.0.0",
    "@dnd-kit/utilities": "^3.2.2",
    "@tailwindcss/postcss": "^4.3.3",
    "@types/node": "^26.1.1",
    "@types/react": "^19.2.14",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.2.3",
    "@types/ws": "^8.18.1",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^6.0.4",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^4.1.10",
    "@xterm/addon-fit": "^0.11.0",
    "@xterm/addon-webgl": "^0.19.0",
    "@xterm/xterm": "^6.0.0",
    "autoprefixer": "^10.5.4",
    "eslint": "^10.8.0",
    "eslint-plugin-react-hooks": "^7.1.1",
    "happy-dom": "^20.11.1",
    "postcss": "^8.5.23",
    "react": "^19.2.8",
    "react-dom": "^19.2.8",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.3.3",
    "tsx": "^4.23.1",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.65.0",
    "vite": "^8.1.5",
    "vitest": "^4.1.10"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@babel/parser": "^7.29.7",
    "@fastify/multipart": "^10.1.0",
    "@fastify/static": "^10.1.2",
    "@fastify/websocket": "^11.3.0",
    "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk": "^1.29.0",
    "@playwright/test": "^1.62.0",
    "@toon-format/toon": "^4.1.0",
    "ast-types": "^0.16.1",
    "dotenv": "^16.6.1",
    "fastify": "^5.10.0",
    "mammoth": "^1.12.0",
    "node-pty": "^1.1.0",
    "pdf-parse": "^2.4.5",
    "react-markdown": "^10.1.0",
    "recast": "^0.23.12",
    "remark-gfm": "^4.0.1",
    "shiki": "^4.3.1",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "ws": "^8.21.1",
    "zod": "^4.4.3"
  },
  "//overrides": [
    "Transitive pin for GHSA-frvp-7c67-39w9 — path traversal in @hono/node-server's",
    "serveStatic on Windows, patched in 2.0.5. There is no patched 1.x.",
    "",
    "Why a pin is needed: @modelcontextprotocol/sdk@1.29.0 (latest) hard-declares",
    "^1.19.9, so ordinary resolution cannot reach the fix. `npm audit fix` instead",
    "proposes downgrading the SDK below 1.25.0 — back into GHSA-345p-7cg4-v4c7",
    "(cross-client data leak) and GHSA-8r9q-7v3j-jr4g (ReDoS), both high. It trades",
    "one moderate for two highs and reports that as fixAvailable. Do not run it here.",
    "",
    "Why the major bump is safe: the SDK imports one symbol, getRequestListener,",
    "whose type signature is identical in 1.19.17 and 2.0.12. The vulnerable",
    "serveStatic is a separate subpath export that nothing in this tree imports.",
    "Verified by typecheck, the MCP suite, and a live initialize round-trip.",
    "",
    "Note: npm overrides are honored only in the root project, so this does NOT",
    "protect anyone installing canary-lab as a dependency — only an upstream bump does.",
    "",
    "REMOVE this override once the SDK widens its range to ^1.19.9 || ^2 — tracked at",
    "https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/typescript-sdk/issues/2531"
  ],
  "overrides": {
    "@hono/node-server": "^2.0.5"
  }
}
